WEBVTT

01:40.800 --> 01:42.480
WEIBEI

01:42.560 --> 01:44.600
Mei Lin's tokens are indeed fake.

01:48.600 --> 01:49.680
Investigate the fake tokens thoroughly,

01:49.760 --> 01:50.800
as well as all the personnel

01:50.880 --> 01:52.600
in the Military Regulations Department
back then.

01:53.560 --> 01:55.600
Perhaps this can truly prove
that the Eastern Palace was the culprit.

01:55.680 --> 01:57.160
No wonder you stopped
carrying out the plan

01:57.240 --> 01:58.160
and took the risk to save Mei Lin.

01:59.560 --> 02:01.760
My lord, your injury…

02:02.880 --> 02:04.160
It can't kill me.

02:05.520 --> 02:09.280
To protect himself, the Crown Prince
will necessarily stay with Zhang Yin.

02:11.080 --> 02:13.000
Once our scheme to sow discord succeeds,

02:13.080 --> 02:14.520
all we need to do

02:14.600 --> 02:16.640
is to wait until Zhang Yin turns
against the Crown Prince.

02:17.760 --> 02:20.960
Keep a close eye on Zhang Yin.
Report any sign of movement immediately.

02:21.800 --> 02:22.720
Yes.

02:22.800 --> 02:25.320
Carry the things sent by General Yin
to the warehouse.

02:25.400 --> 02:26.320
Take it slow.

02:26.840 --> 02:27.840
This way.

02:29.800 --> 02:31.280
Everyone, be careful.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.920
General Yin is returning
to the capital for recuperation.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.280
She is still on the road

02:40.360 --> 02:42.200
while ordering her men to send
these boxes of tonics over.

02:42.920 --> 02:43.760
My lord,

02:43.840 --> 02:46.120
General Yin still thinks of you
after all these years.

02:46.200 --> 02:47.080
Proceed with the standard
inventory process.

02:47.160 --> 02:48.200
Yes.

02:52.920 --> 02:54.800
If General Yin comes,
report to me immediately.

02:58.720 --> 03:00.800
ZHIGE HALL

03:04.120 --> 03:05.920
Upon hearing that Prince Jing
was assassinated,

03:06.000 --> 03:07.480
you rushed back to Zhaojing overnight.

03:07.560 --> 03:10.040
You didn't even take
a sip of water on the road.

03:10.720 --> 03:12.320
Why don't you

03:12.400 --> 03:14.120
go to Prince Jing's Mansion
to visit him now?

03:17.960 --> 03:19.320
I don't need to go visit him in person.

03:20.040 --> 03:21.120
I've sent him the tonics.

03:21.840 --> 03:23.320
If he wishes to reciprocate the gesture,

03:23.400 --> 03:24.480
he will visit me in person.

03:25.680 --> 03:28.600
You send him gifts every day.
He's never given you anything in return.

03:29.200 --> 03:31.120
Why bother go through such trouble?

03:35.240 --> 03:37.920
Here's the portrait of the Xiyan Beauty
who tried to assassinate Prince Jing.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.840
I asked you to investigate her identity.

03:42.920 --> 03:44.320
Why are you giving me her portrait?

03:46.840 --> 03:49.240
I've investigated her identity.
There's nothing wrong about it.

03:49.960 --> 03:52.120
The Imperial Edict
should be telling the truth.

03:52.200 --> 03:53.200
She couldn't bear being insulted.

03:53.280 --> 03:54.640
That was why she tried
to assassinate Prince Jing.

03:56.840 --> 03:58.120
She's got some backbone.

03:58.200 --> 04:01.320
Prince Jing has truly become
more and more reckless over the years.

04:01.400 --> 04:02.720
Why do you still think about him?

04:03.440 --> 04:04.480
We were comrades once.

04:05.320 --> 04:07.640
I'd hate to see him go down.

04:08.800 --> 04:09.880
However,

04:11.040 --> 04:13.480
I think he has changed his mind now.

04:14.600 --> 04:16.279
Regarding the assassination attempt
by the Xiyan Beauty before the Emperor,

04:16.360 --> 04:17.839
his plea for leniency
was merely to preserve

04:18.720 --> 04:21.000
the big picture of the alliance
between the two nations.

04:23.040 --> 04:23.880
Hurry.

04:24.400 --> 04:25.640
Hurry up.

04:26.800 --> 04:28.920
Move them to the warehouse. Hurry.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.880
Is this the return gift from Prince Jing?

04:32.480 --> 04:33.360
No.

04:34.080 --> 04:36.200
General, the Crown Prince
sent these to you

04:36.280 --> 04:37.600
to congratulate you
on returning to the capital.

04:39.000 --> 04:40.320
Pick a few pieces
from what we've brought back

04:40.400 --> 04:42.720
and send them to the Crown Prince
as our return gift.

04:42.800 --> 04:43.880
Yes.

04:48.840 --> 04:50.480
GENERAL'S MANSION

05:02.240 --> 05:05.560
13 YEARS AGO

05:18.880 --> 05:20.360
LUOMEI AS A TEENAGER

05:21.600 --> 05:23.240
JINGHE AS A TEENAGER

05:26.080 --> 05:27.360
You are too unruly.

05:27.440 --> 05:30.040
His Majesty says
as long as I can defeat you,

05:30.120 --> 05:31.600
I can go with you
on the expedition to Xiyan.

05:31.680 --> 05:32.840
I can't let you win then.

05:33.560 --> 05:36.480
On the battlefield,
I won't be able to protect you.

05:36.560 --> 05:37.880
I don't need your protection.

05:45.400 --> 05:47.160
It's made of supreme cold iron.

05:47.240 --> 05:48.280
It's the only one.

05:49.000 --> 05:50.360
Give it to me.

05:50.440 --> 05:51.280
Same rule.

05:51.880 --> 05:52.880
If you win, it'll be yours.

06:08.080 --> 06:09.760
I win.

06:12.120 --> 06:13.400
General Yin, you're superb
in martial arts.

06:13.480 --> 06:15.360
I willingly admit defeat.

06:17.080 --> 06:18.200
However,

06:18.280 --> 06:19.280
since I've given you a treasure,

06:19.360 --> 06:20.800
you should give me one too.

06:20.880 --> 06:22.000
What do you want?

06:22.080 --> 06:24.960
When I think of what return gift I want,
I'll tell you.

06:59.520 --> 07:02.560
I knew you would rise again.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.200
General Yin,

07:06.720 --> 07:08.680
we haven't seen each other for many years.

07:09.240 --> 07:12.240
Today, let's get drunk together.

07:19.520 --> 07:22.640
It's a pity that there is only wine.

07:23.640 --> 07:25.080
There isn't enough fun.

07:27.960 --> 07:31.000
Shall we get a few dancers here
to liven things up?

07:33.160 --> 07:35.240
There are no dancers
in the General's Mansion.

07:39.640 --> 07:40.800
What a pity.

07:47.120 --> 07:51.440
I heard you obtained a treasure
from Nanyang.

07:51.520 --> 07:53.200
Red Coix Seed.

07:53.840 --> 07:58.240
I heard it could eliminate all worries.

07:59.520 --> 08:00.720
Dukang and Red Coix Seed,

08:01.280 --> 08:03.720
which do you think

08:05.000 --> 08:06.920
can better eliminate worries?

08:09.080 --> 08:11.240
Is this why you've come
to the General's Mansion?

08:14.640 --> 08:17.800
If you are willing to give me some…

08:19.600 --> 08:22.840
Do you know that prolonged use of it
can cause loss of consciousness?

08:24.000 --> 08:25.080
I do.

08:26.000 --> 08:30.160
But I can see you are very clear-minded.

08:32.720 --> 08:35.120
I take Red Coix Seeds to kill the pain,

08:35.840 --> 08:37.760
but you want to use it
to escape and sink into oblivion.

08:38.559 --> 08:40.200
I thought you had come around.

08:43.880 --> 08:45.280
I have.

08:47.520 --> 08:48.760
Having a beautiful companion by my side,

08:49.480 --> 08:50.760
with fine wine at hand,

08:51.560 --> 08:54.920
is much more carefree and enjoyable

08:55.000 --> 08:56.800
than those days of waiting vigilantly
with weapons.

08:59.960 --> 09:02.680
Blowing the horn in the allied camps,
marshaling troops on the battlefield,

09:02.760 --> 09:04.160
protecting the borders of Great Yan,

09:04.240 --> 09:05.640
and ensuring peace.

09:06.600 --> 09:09.440
Have you forgotten
all your grand ambitions, General Weibei?

09:16.280 --> 09:19.840
There is no General Weibei anymore.

09:20.800 --> 09:23.520
Now, I'm the carefree Prince Jing.

09:32.600 --> 09:34.960
The Weibei Army is gone,
but we still have Pingnan Army.

09:35.760 --> 09:37.240
As long as you can find
your ambitions back.

09:38.360 --> 09:40.080
I am a guilty man.

09:41.360 --> 09:43.880
You're asking the guilty man
to lead the troops.

09:44.800 --> 09:48.160
I'm too embarrassed to face
the people in Qingzhou.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.760
Qingzhou has been burnt,

09:50.840 --> 09:52.600
but as long as Qingzhou still exists,

09:52.680 --> 09:54.920
it can nourish numerous people
of Great Yan.

09:55.640 --> 09:57.200
That's thanks to your efforts.

09:57.280 --> 09:58.720
War always involves casualties.

09:59.560 --> 10:02.400
Let the loss of the Weibei Army
in Qingzhou serve as amends.

10:08.480 --> 10:10.640
It's not worth sacrificing
General Weibei again.

10:18.320 --> 10:22.520
Your words are truly enlightening.

10:24.000 --> 10:26.400
Unfortunately, I have been troubled
for many years,

10:27.440 --> 10:29.920
and it's hard to resolve it
for the moment.

10:30.720 --> 10:33.560
I've come for the Red Coix Seeds.

10:34.280 --> 10:38.040
I hope you are willing to spare me some.

10:44.760 --> 10:45.600
Okay.

10:46.920 --> 10:48.120
Same rule.

10:48.640 --> 10:49.920
If you win, it'll be yours.

10:55.720 --> 10:58.400
General, you're superb in martial arts.

10:58.480 --> 11:01.240
You are better
than all warriors in Great Yan.

11:01.840 --> 11:02.840
I…

11:03.600 --> 11:05.320
willingly admit defeat.

11:06.680 --> 11:09.880
This way, I can't give you
any Red Coix Seeds.

11:11.320 --> 11:12.520
General Yin,

11:13.800 --> 11:15.240
it's time for you to give me a return gift

11:18.080 --> 11:19.000
for this dagger.

11:25.160 --> 11:27.440
WENHUA PAVILION

11:34.640 --> 11:35.680
Who is there?

11:45.640 --> 11:47.000
ACHYRANTHES ROOT

11:47.600 --> 11:49.400
Undying.

11:50.480 --> 11:51.400
GENERAL'S MANSION

11:51.480 --> 11:52.440
My lord,

11:55.600 --> 11:57.160
Zhang Yin went to the Wenhua Pavilion.
So did Mei Lin.

12:20.880 --> 12:23.800
Meiniang, please help me go to Xiyan.

12:24.800 --> 12:25.640
Minister Zhang,

12:26.520 --> 12:29.400
our deal is over.

12:30.960 --> 12:32.320
If I die,

12:32.400 --> 12:34.520
you can't stay
in Court of State Ceremonial anymore.

12:40.160 --> 12:41.480
With this,

12:42.360 --> 12:43.720
someone will be there to meet you.

12:44.320 --> 12:45.440
Thank you, Meiniang.

13:14.880 --> 13:16.960
Greetings, my lord.
All Momai Warriors are in place.

13:18.640 --> 13:21.600
Momai is the Master of Shadow Works.

13:21.680 --> 13:23.160
Prince Jing has discovered us.

13:23.240 --> 13:25.440
If the Qingzhou case is re-reopened,
we'll only die.

13:25.520 --> 13:27.320
Everyone, abort the mission

13:27.400 --> 13:28.280
and go into hiding among the civilians.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.280
Yes.

13:32.640 --> 13:36.560
Tonight, no one must be left alive
at Wenhua Pavilion.

13:39.160 --> 13:40.480
So, you're the true culprit
of the Qingzhou massacre.

14:33.840 --> 14:34.880
It's the phosphorus-coated garment.

14:36.600 --> 14:37.880
Who did this?

14:41.240 --> 14:42.400
RED COIX SEED

15:04.040 --> 15:06.160
XINWEI

15:13.120 --> 15:15.320
- What's happening?
- Yeah. What's going on?

15:15.400 --> 15:17.280
Such a big fire. Look.

15:17.360 --> 15:19.640
WENHUA PAVILION

16:39.360 --> 16:44.520
FANGHUA PALACE

16:46.600 --> 16:48.360
Chagu, what time is it?

16:48.440 --> 16:50.360
His Majesty will come to Fanghua Palace
at the hour of Xu.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.320
That's an hour later.

16:55.360 --> 16:57.440
Where is the dagger
that my brother gave me?

17:00.960 --> 17:02.400
Your Highness,

17:02.480 --> 17:03.920
Eunuch Liu said

17:04.000 --> 17:06.760
keeping a blade while sleeping
with His Majesty is a severe crime.

17:06.839 --> 17:10.079
Your Highness, if you do it again,
His Majesty…

17:10.160 --> 17:11.920
- His Majesty will really punish you.
- It's okay.

17:12.000 --> 17:13.280
We won't let him know.

17:14.119 --> 17:16.480
His Majesty has arrived.

17:54.120 --> 17:55.960
Greetings, Your Majesty.

17:58.280 --> 18:00.440
Are you afraid of me?

18:02.640 --> 18:03.560
No, I'm not.

18:14.240 --> 18:16.440
Your Majesty, I don't…

18:16.960 --> 18:19.960
I… I… I won't… I…

18:20.040 --> 18:21.440
I know you won't.

18:22.360 --> 18:23.440
You're just afraid.

18:29.920 --> 18:30.880
Yes.

18:32.080 --> 18:34.040
I'm indeed a little afraid.

18:35.960 --> 18:37.360
My mother and my brother

18:37.440 --> 18:40.120
left this dagger to me.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.320
With it, I don't feel afraid anymore.

18:53.200 --> 18:54.920
Do you know what this is?

18:57.080 --> 18:57.920
Yes.

18:58.000 --> 19:00.680
This is for testing chastity
on the bridal night.

19:00.760 --> 19:02.560
The nanny told me about it.

19:09.720 --> 19:10.560
Come over.

19:12.640 --> 19:13.960
Yes.

19:20.720 --> 19:21.880
Give me your hand.

19:30.880 --> 19:31.760
Bear with it.

19:43.720 --> 19:46.120
What I want is not Concubine Yan,

19:46.840 --> 19:49.280
but peace between Great Yan and Xiyan.

19:49.800 --> 19:52.520
As long as you can stay
in Great Yan harem with peace of mind,

19:53.400 --> 19:54.960
I won't force you.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.800
Only when you figure this out

20:08.160 --> 20:09.440
can you get

20:10.200 --> 20:11.080
this dagger back.

20:15.000 --> 20:16.160
Your Majesty.

20:18.320 --> 20:20.200
I understand.

20:47.160 --> 20:50.200
FANGHUA PALACE

20:58.240 --> 20:59.480
My lord, Wenhua Pavilion is on fire.

21:01.520 --> 21:03.680
I see. You may leave.

21:23.360 --> 21:24.840
Found it.

21:26.040 --> 21:26.880
What did you find?

21:28.920 --> 21:30.200
Guanzhong.

21:34.560 --> 21:36.120
Its grassy leaves resemble
a phoenix's tail,

21:36.640 --> 21:38.520
and its root is single
but connected to many branches.

21:39.240 --> 21:40.440
Hence the root is named Guanzhong.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.120
It can stop bleeding and remove toxins.

21:59.000 --> 22:00.080
Are you crazy?

22:00.160 --> 22:01.480
The resin of the Formosan gum

22:02.480 --> 22:04.640
is slightly bitter and can stop bleeding
and promote saliva production.

22:08.360 --> 22:09.200
My tongue isn't working well.

22:12.400 --> 22:14.720
The Chinese gum tree has tall branches,

22:15.320 --> 22:16.840
with bark that is gray-brown in color.

22:17.440 --> 22:19.360
The twigs are covered with fine hairs,

22:21.520 --> 22:23.200
and the leaves are red,

22:24.160 --> 22:25.200
triangular in shape,

22:26.200 --> 22:27.320
and fragrant.

22:38.120 --> 22:39.960
The Northern Snow Lotus Pill
neutralizes all toxins.

22:41.600 --> 22:42.800
Nanyang Red Coix Seed
neutralizes all toxins.

22:44.880 --> 22:47.520
Guqing Powder neutralizes all toxins.

22:51.720 --> 22:52.840
You don't need to look for it anymore.

22:52.920 --> 22:54.960
I've found the Red Coix Seeds.

22:55.040 --> 22:56.720
We've found the Red Coix Seeds

22:59.000 --> 23:00.080
and the enemies.

23:01.680 --> 23:03.000
Wenhua Pavilion.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.400
Momai Warriors.

23:10.920 --> 23:12.200
The Master of Shadow Works.

23:28.240 --> 23:30.800
My lord, why did Mei Lin
suddenly lose her sanity?

23:30.880 --> 23:32.760
She took some Red Coix Seeds
and had hallucinations.

23:32.840 --> 23:35.640
She went to Wenhua Pavilion
to look for Red Coix Seeds?

23:36.160 --> 23:38.480
Momai Warriors may be hiding
in Wenhua Pavilion.

23:39.440 --> 23:41.960
Qingyan, go to Wenhua Pavilion right now
and look for Zhang Yin.

23:42.040 --> 23:43.440
I must see him, dead or alive.

23:43.520 --> 23:44.360
Yes.

24:33.280 --> 24:36.400
What did you see in Wenhua Pavilion?

24:38.640 --> 24:39.480
I saw you.

24:43.920 --> 24:44.920
Greetings, my lord.

25:04.960 --> 25:06.120
If you explain clearly,

25:07.160 --> 25:08.200
I can spare your life.

25:25.120 --> 25:26.840
I've got the Red Coix Seeds.

25:28.440 --> 25:30.280
You can't make me kill anymore.

25:30.360 --> 25:32.760
I'm not your killing machine.

25:34.320 --> 25:38.040
You took advantage of the grudges
in Qingzhou to kill innocent people.

25:38.640 --> 25:41.320
General Weibei was wronged.
He shouldn't die.

25:43.120 --> 25:44.720
The one who should die is you,

25:45.320 --> 25:46.800
the Master of Shadow Works.

25:49.200 --> 25:50.600
She is having hallucinations again.

26:05.400 --> 26:06.240
Does it hurt?

26:07.640 --> 26:09.440
You can't feel pain in Shadow Works.

26:11.960 --> 26:14.400
You turned me into a killing machine.

26:16.880 --> 26:19.640
The first lesson in Shadow Works
is taking a beating…

26:23.840 --> 26:25.120
which will never stop.

26:26.160 --> 26:27.000
It won't stop.

26:31.040 --> 26:32.160
It won't stop…

26:34.440 --> 26:35.920
until you die in pain…

26:40.760 --> 26:42.480
or no longer cry in pain.

27:13.880 --> 27:15.320
Try this.

27:18.680 --> 27:19.680
Father.

27:20.200 --> 27:21.240
Mother.

27:22.720 --> 27:24.600
Father. Mother.

27:26.200 --> 27:27.400
Come.

27:27.480 --> 27:28.440
My dear daughter.

27:30.880 --> 27:33.680
Your mother only allows me to drink
one pot today. Don't take it from me.

27:34.720 --> 27:36.400
Mother, Father won't give me the wine.

27:36.480 --> 27:38.800
Complaining won't work. You can't drink.

27:38.880 --> 27:41.600
Here. Have a fruit cake. Here.

27:43.880 --> 27:44.960
- Is it sweet?
- Yes.

27:46.080 --> 27:48.000
You make the sweetest fruit cakes, Mother.

27:48.080 --> 27:49.200
Of course.

27:50.080 --> 27:51.440
I've got a plan.

27:51.520 --> 27:52.960
After the Weibei Army enters the city,

27:53.040 --> 27:55.240
Father, you'll carry on
with the stonework.

27:56.400 --> 27:58.360
Mother, you'll open a fruit cake store.

27:58.960 --> 28:00.720
I'm sure the business will be great.

28:00.800 --> 28:02.800
You want me to carry on
with the stonework. What will you do?

28:02.880 --> 28:04.120
- Right.
- I'll protect Mother.

28:05.880 --> 28:07.280
Mother.

28:10.960 --> 28:12.520
What is it?

28:12.600 --> 28:14.360
Girl,

28:14.440 --> 28:16.520
this stone hairpin was made
by your father for your dowry.

28:16.600 --> 28:18.520
Why do you put it in my hair?

28:18.600 --> 28:19.960
I won't get married.

28:20.040 --> 28:22.400
Nonsense. All girls will get married.

28:23.320 --> 28:25.120
Rest assured. Even if you get married,

28:25.200 --> 28:27.680
your father and I
won't let you get bullied.

28:30.520 --> 28:31.640
With my skills,

28:32.440 --> 28:34.480
I'll be the bully.

28:35.080 --> 28:37.440
It's not easy to find a husband
who can be bullied.

28:37.520 --> 28:38.760
Don't think about it anymore.

28:38.840 --> 28:39.920
It's fine you don't get married.

28:40.000 --> 28:41.840
- I'll raise you for your entire life.
- You must get married.

28:42.360 --> 28:43.840
- She won't.
- I won't.

28:43.920 --> 28:45.280
- You have to.
- I won't.

28:45.360 --> 28:47.280
- Never.
- Never.

28:47.880 --> 28:49.240
Then don't.

29:21.560 --> 29:22.680
I'm homeless now.

29:28.120 --> 29:29.640
I can't go home.

29:53.400 --> 29:54.800
My parents said

29:55.680 --> 29:58.160
where there were spring flowers,
there was home.

29:59.560 --> 30:03.240
If I see spring flowers,
I can find my way home.

30:15.000 --> 30:17.640
Little flower, go home with me.

30:19.280 --> 30:21.400
Won't you go home with me?

30:21.480 --> 30:22.600
Let's go.

30:23.360 --> 30:24.720
Let's go.

30:25.880 --> 30:26.720
Go home with me.

30:28.160 --> 30:29.040
The flower is here.

30:39.280 --> 30:40.440
Go home with me.

30:54.560 --> 30:55.440
Here is another flower.

31:13.840 --> 31:15.040
Here is another one.

31:31.000 --> 31:31.840
Here are two.

31:45.960 --> 31:47.400
Here are many.

31:56.160 --> 31:57.320
We are home.

32:42.840 --> 32:44.320
My lord,

32:44.400 --> 32:47.160
I took the lady's pulse just now.

32:47.240 --> 32:49.640
The Momai poison in her body
hasn't been neutralized.

32:49.720 --> 32:52.640
The effects of Red Coix Seeds have
the signs of her poisoning disappear,

32:52.720 --> 32:54.280
but it only eased the onset of the poison,

32:54.360 --> 32:56.040
buying her one year.

32:56.120 --> 32:58.360
Red Coix Seed could normally detoxify,

32:58.440 --> 33:01.360
but Mei Lin's constitution
is different from most people's.

33:01.440 --> 33:03.680
It seems that during her time wandering,

33:03.760 --> 33:04.920
she ate too much spoiled food to survive,

33:05.000 --> 33:06.400
which damaged her health.

33:06.480 --> 33:09.400
If she takes more
Red Coix Seeds now to detoxify,

33:09.480 --> 33:11.560
it will cause her immediate death.

33:11.640 --> 33:13.080
Without the antidote,

33:13.160 --> 33:16.320
the hope brought by Red Coix Seeds
will just be meaningless.

33:20.680 --> 33:22.240
Are there any other methods?

33:22.320 --> 33:25.240
I can prepare an antidote for the lady,

33:25.320 --> 33:27.320
but it requires
many rare medicinal materials.

33:27.400 --> 33:28.920
Gathering them all will be no easy task.

33:29.880 --> 33:30.960
Find them as soon as possible.

33:31.040 --> 33:32.040
Tell me if you need anything.

33:32.120 --> 33:34.360
The lady only has one year left.

33:34.920 --> 33:37.280
Even if we manage to prepare the antidote,

33:37.360 --> 33:38.960
she might not survive until then.

33:42.280 --> 33:43.520
If she can't survive until then,

33:44.560 --> 33:46.160
that's her fate.

33:51.120 --> 33:53.560
WAN'AN HALL

34:12.520 --> 34:13.360
Mr. Wang,

34:13.440 --> 34:14.960
His Highness is still copying
scriptures in the temple.

34:15.040 --> 34:16.000
No one is allowed to disturb him.

34:16.080 --> 34:18.760
- How can you forget the rules?
- Alright.

34:37.159 --> 34:38.199
Your Highness.

34:44.360 --> 34:47.080
WAN'AN HALL

34:47.719 --> 34:50.080
Your Highness,
Wenhua Pavilion has been burnt to ashes,

34:50.159 --> 34:52.400
and so has Zhang Yin.

34:52.480 --> 34:54.679
Only this jade ring was left.

34:55.520 --> 34:57.400
He should have died back then.

34:57.480 --> 34:58.920
Your Highness let him live ten more years.

34:59.000 --> 35:00.400
He should be satisfied.

35:01.040 --> 35:02.200
Where is my third brother?

35:03.200 --> 35:06.000
When Prince Jing's men arrived
at Wenhua Pavilion, it was too late.

35:06.720 --> 35:07.920
Now that Zhang Yin is dead,

35:08.000 --> 35:11.040
the evidence Prince Jing possesses
cannot be substantiated.

35:14.080 --> 35:15.080
What a pity.

35:16.680 --> 35:20.040
So many treasures in Wenhua Pavilion
were burnt to ashes.

35:20.840 --> 35:22.040
When it was first built,

35:22.760 --> 35:25.040
my third brother and I went inside
and stole the Zhanyun Sword.

35:27.560 --> 35:30.040
Jinghe, if possible,

35:30.120 --> 35:32.600
I still want to be your eldest brother.

35:45.680 --> 35:48.280
Your Majesty, I've lost.

35:49.120 --> 35:50.880
It wasn't easy for you.

35:50.960 --> 35:52.400
Every time you play chess with me,

35:52.480 --> 35:55.360
you have to devote extra effort
to calculating

35:55.960 --> 35:58.000
exactly how many moves
you should let me win by.

36:01.040 --> 36:02.160
Your Majesty is wise and discerning.

36:02.240 --> 36:04.120
Your Majesty plays with great strength

36:04.200 --> 36:06.400
and always sees the big picture
with every move,

36:06.480 --> 36:09.960
whereas I am preoccupied with minor gains
in the corners of the board.

36:10.040 --> 36:12.200
Ultimately, it is due
to my inferior skills

36:12.280 --> 36:14.000
that I always lose to Your Majesty.

36:18.360 --> 36:20.160
You are about to leave the capital.

36:20.240 --> 36:22.280
It's hard for me

36:22.360 --> 36:24.720
to find another chess mate like you.

36:25.480 --> 36:28.840
I've been troubling by something,
and I can't fall asleep.

36:32.360 --> 36:34.640
Only when you return to Xiyan

36:35.240 --> 36:36.680
can you help me solve this problem.

36:44.440 --> 36:46.960
I have recently made some scented powder

36:47.040 --> 36:48.840
that has a calming effect.

36:49.920 --> 36:50.760
I hope it can help relieve

36:51.400 --> 36:52.720
Your Majesty's fatigue
from official duties.

36:54.160 --> 36:55.120
Light it.

37:12.800 --> 37:14.680
It has the fresh scent of plum blossoms.

37:14.760 --> 37:16.800
This incense is called
Spring Message in the Snow,

37:17.400 --> 37:20.080
and I made it following the recipe
from the Hermit of Dongli.

37:20.960 --> 37:23.240
It's made of the snow melted
on plum blossoms in the first month

37:23.320 --> 37:25.840
as well as agarwood, truffles,

37:25.920 --> 37:27.720
linden, and over a dozen
other ingredients.

37:28.320 --> 37:30.800
After being kneaded and pounded
for 49 days, it was made.

37:32.520 --> 37:34.480
You're skilled at playing Guqin,
playing chess, calligraphy, painting,

37:34.560 --> 37:35.880
arranging flowers, betting on bird fights,

37:35.960 --> 37:37.120
brewing wine, and making incense.

37:37.720 --> 37:40.440
It seems to me there is nothing
you cannot do in this world.

37:41.040 --> 37:44.480
What I know is merely trivial pastimes
of little use,

37:45.080 --> 37:46.720
and yet I am honored
by Your Majesty's praise.

37:46.800 --> 37:50.000
But when I go back to Xiyan,
what can I do?

37:50.600 --> 37:53.600
It is my lifelong wish

37:53.680 --> 37:55.280
that Great Yan and Xiyan
maintain a lasting friendship.

37:56.320 --> 37:57.800
With my intent to cease hostilities

37:57.880 --> 37:59.600
and Xiyan's desire for peace,

37:59.680 --> 38:01.280
no conflict will arise.

38:01.360 --> 38:02.960
When you go back to Xiyan,

38:03.040 --> 38:04.840
there is a lot you can do.

38:07.800 --> 38:10.000
I pledge to do my utmost
for the peace between our two nations.

38:11.040 --> 38:13.880
Before I leave, I have one more request

38:15.000 --> 38:16.720
concerning the arrangement
for the peace-making Beauties,

38:16.800 --> 38:19.080
which may help to bridge the gap
between our two nations.

38:23.240 --> 38:26.000
Great Yan is a land
of etiquette and culture,

38:26.080 --> 38:29.480
whereas most of these Beauties
come from places that are less civilized,

38:29.560 --> 38:31.640
leading to a lack of understanding
of Yan customs and traditions,

38:31.720 --> 38:33.080
which can easily result
in misunderstandings.

38:33.160 --> 38:35.120
I believe that if the Beauties
in the Court of State Ceremonial

38:35.200 --> 38:37.960
can first learn the culture and customs
before being allocated,

38:38.040 --> 38:39.600
it can foster mutual understanding

38:39.680 --> 38:42.680
and uphold the original intention
of friendship between our two nations.

38:45.400 --> 38:46.560
That's a great plan.

38:48.200 --> 38:50.320
If Your Majesty trusts me,

38:50.400 --> 38:52.240
I am willing to teach these Beauties

38:52.320 --> 38:54.360
and do my utmost
to promote the culture of Great Yan.

38:54.440 --> 38:56.480
I will go back to Xiyan

38:57.200 --> 38:58.960
after the Beauties
finished their learning.

39:10.680 --> 39:13.560
I know you are worried
about Concubine Yan.

39:13.640 --> 39:16.320
But Concubine Yan is a symbol of peace
between the two nations.

39:16.400 --> 39:18.440
As long as Great Yan and Xiyan
maintain good relations,

39:19.040 --> 39:22.440
Concubine Yan can live out
her days peacefully in Great Yan.

39:23.720 --> 39:26.760
Considering that it's rare
for you and your sister to reunite,

39:27.520 --> 39:28.680
I allow you

39:28.760 --> 39:31.120
to oversee the teaching arrangements
at the Court of State Ceremonial.

39:31.640 --> 39:34.640
After the marriage alliance is formed,
you can go back to Xiyan.

39:36.480 --> 39:38.960
I will live up
to Your Majesty's expectations of me.

39:39.480 --> 39:40.960
I'll take my leave.

39:49.560 --> 39:51.480
After Mr. Yue Qin goes back to Xiyan,

39:52.680 --> 39:55.240
it'll be hard for Concubine Yan
to see him again.

39:57.000 --> 39:59.720
In three days, school starts
at Court of State Ceremonial.

40:01.000 --> 40:02.960
Let Concubine Yan
go to Court of State Ceremonial.

40:04.000 --> 40:05.040
to take a look.

40:05.920 --> 40:06.880
Yes.

40:16.200 --> 40:17.960
A dead piece

40:18.720 --> 40:20.520
has somehow made a way out.

40:23.840 --> 40:24.680
My lord,

40:24.760 --> 40:27.120
Wenhua Pavilion has been burned to ruins,
and the bodies are unrecognizable.

40:29.560 --> 40:32.520
ZHANYUE PAVILION

41:07.240 --> 41:08.600
The poison has really been neutralized.

41:12.040 --> 41:13.840
What did you see in Wenhua Pavilion?

41:15.240 --> 41:16.280
My lord.

41:29.760 --> 41:31.040
I saw the Master of Shadow Works.

41:31.920 --> 41:33.520
- The Master of Shadow Works.
- Yes.

41:34.840 --> 41:35.720
He said

41:35.800 --> 41:38.240
you had found his involvement
in the Qingzhou massacre.

41:38.320 --> 41:40.680
He asked all Momai Warriors
to stop their actions.

41:41.400 --> 41:44.560
Did you see a middle-aged man
with a scar on his eyebrow?

41:45.440 --> 41:48.240
- Who is he?
- The Minister of Defense, Zhang Yin.

41:48.840 --> 41:49.880
Zhang Yin.

41:50.400 --> 41:51.440
He was the true culprit.

41:53.080 --> 41:54.320
He didn't die in Wenhua Pavilion.

41:54.920 --> 41:55.880
He escaped through a secret passage.

41:58.000 --> 42:00.400
All Momai Warriors were wearing
phosphorus-coated garments.

42:01.240 --> 42:02.320
Obviously, they were silenced.

42:02.960 --> 42:04.600
Does the arsonist of Wenhua Pavilion

42:04.680 --> 42:06.160
have something to do
with the Qingzhou massacre?

42:09.120 --> 42:10.360
I'm also investigating it.

42:11.400 --> 42:13.440
Why did Zhang Yin
commit arson in Qingzhou?

42:13.520 --> 42:16.480
After the battle of Qingzhou,
I dismissed him from his position.

42:16.560 --> 42:17.520
He has harbored resentment ever since.

42:18.440 --> 42:20.160
If he wanted to kill you,

42:20.240 --> 42:23.200
he could send many Momai Warriors
like me to carry out the task.

42:23.280 --> 42:26.240
Why did he have to sacrifice
100,000 innocent Qingzhou people?

42:26.320 --> 42:27.600
I also want to know why.

42:28.480 --> 42:30.040
He can try if he wants to kill me.

42:30.120 --> 42:33.320
Why should the innocent
Weibei Army soldiers be sacrificed?
